config MONA2_PROFILE_BASE_LAYER
    bool "Switch base layer (MAC/WIN) to match the active BT profile"
    depends on ZMK_BLE && (!ZMK_SPLIT || ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL)
    help
      When the active BLE profile changes (including the first time after
      boot), activate the matching base layer: profile 0 -> layer 0 (MAC),
      profiles 1 and 2 -> layer 1 (WIN). Layers are not persisted, so
      without this a reboot of the central leaves the keyboard on MAC even
      though it reconnects to the Windows profile.
